---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import bgImage from '../assets/bg-home-2.png';
---

<section class="benefits">
	<div class="benefits__background">
		<Image src={bgImage} alt="" class="benefits__bg-image" />
	</div>

	<div class="benefits__container">
		<h2 class="benefits__title">
			Beneficios estratégicos<br />
			<span class="benefits__title--highlight">Para tu línea de montaje.</span>
		</h2>

		<div class="benefits__grid">
			<div class="benefits__card">
				<svg class="benefits__card-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
					<polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon>
				</svg>
				<h3 class="benefits__card-title">Diferenciación real<br />en el mercado.</h3>
				<p class="benefits__card-text">Genera una ventaja competitiva única al incorporar tecnología patentada de disipación calórica como estándar de fábrica.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="benefits__card">
				<svg class="benefits__card-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
					<line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"></line>
					<path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path>
				</svg>
				<h3 class="benefits__card-title">Mayor valor<br />percibido.</h3>
				<p class="benefits__card-text">Aporta un componente tecnológico premium, visible y funcional que justifica y respalda el posicionamiento comercial de gamas superiores.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="benefits__card">
				<svg class="benefits__card-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
					<path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
					<circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
				</svg>
				<h3 class="benefits__card-title">Mejor experiencia<br />de usuario.</h3>
				<p class="benefits__card-text">Protege el prestigio de la marca minimizando incidencias de fatiga extrema en rodajes largos y garantizando un confort superior desde el primer kilómetro.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.benefits {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.benefits__background {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: 0;
	}

	.benefits__bg-image {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: center;
	}

	.benefits__container {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
		padding: 6rem 4rem;
	}

	.benefits__title {
		font-family: 'Just Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.2;
		margin: 0 0 3rem;
		color: #1a1a1a;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
	}

	.benefits__title--highlight {
		color: #ff4d00;
	}

	.benefits__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.benefits__card {
		background: rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.6);
		backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
		border-radius: 12px;
		padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1rem;
		min-width: 0;
	}

	.benefits__card-icon {
		color: #ff4d00;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.benefits__card-title {
		font-family: 'Just Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #ffffff;
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1.3;
	}

	.benefits__card-text {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: #bbbbbb;
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin: 0;
		overflow-wrap: break-word;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.benefits__container {
			padding: 4rem 2rem;
		}

		.benefits__grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}
	}

	@media (min-width: 1440px) {
		.benefits__container {
			padding: 8rem 6rem;
		}

		.benefits__card {
			padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
		}
	}

	@media (min-width: 1920px) {
		.benefits__container {
			padding: 10rem 8rem;
		}
	}
</style>
